\subsection{Claim Factuality Evaluation}
\label{sec:nli_factuality_evaluation}
To evaluate the factuality of individual response claims, we use \texttt{GPT-4o-mini} with Web search enabled to assess each claim on a 5-point Likert scale. The evaluation prompts are provided in Section~\ref{sec:prompts_claim_nli}. 
