The same can be observed for other platforms on \invivo\ and \invitro\, as shown in Appendix Figures~\ref{fig:source_rank_violinplot_tranco_other_platforms} and~\ref{fig:source_rank_violinplot_tranco_insitu_rev}, respectively.


