To complement the observational analysis, we conduct controlled experiments using the frontier models listed in Table~\ref{tab:insitu_stats}. We use the same set of 1,000 user prompts (using only the first user message) that exclude personal information through the platforms' APIs, allowing us to compare Web-search behavior under identical inputs. The details of excluding personal information are provided in Appendix~\ref{app:prompt_selection}. 
