This setup enables controlled comparisons both across providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, xAI, and DeepSeek) and across OpenAI models (\texttt{GPT-5.3-chat}, \texttt{GPT-4.1-mini}, \texttt{GPT-o4-mini}) while keeping the prompts fixed. Throughout the paper, we refer to this \textit{API-based setting} as the \invitro\ setup.

